    {
      "id": "note0",
      "type": "NoteNode",
      "x": -156,
      "y": 216,
      "init": {
        "label": "Kitchen remodel from TaskNotes",
        "body": "# Kitchen remodel, from your tasks\n\n**TaskNotes** reads every task off the plugin's API. Filter keeps the ones whose projects contain \"Kitchen remodel\". Computed Column turns each task's timeEstimate into a Duration in days. **Schedule** works out Start, Finish and the critical path, and the **Gantt** draws it, as Mermaid text and as the figure.\n\nWith no TaskNotes URL set in Settings, the node reads a bundled sample of tasks, so this runs anywhere.",
        "color": "violet",
        "width": 400,
        "height": 210
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "tasknotes",
      "type": "TaskNotesNode",
      "x": -156,
      "y": -36,
      "init": {
        "label": "TaskNotes",
        "provider": "tasks"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "kitchen",
      "type": "FilterFrameNode",
      "x": 347,
      "y": -36,
      "init": {
        "label": "projects contains Kitchen remodel",
        "condConfig": {
          "0": {
            "op": "listContains"
          }
        },
        "valueKeys": [
          "frame",
          "column0",
          "value0"
        ]
      },
      "stringLiterals": {
        "column0": "projects",
        "value0": "Kitchen remodel"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "days",
      "type": "ComputedColumnNode",
      "x": 676,
      "y": 56,
      "init": {
        "label": "Duration = timeEstimate ÷ 8h",
        "expr": "@timeEstimate / 480",
        "addAs": "number"
      },
      "stringLiterals": {
        "name": "Duration",
        "after": ""
      }
    },
